      "source": [
        "## Intro\n",
        "\n",
        "In this lab, you will build an AI agent that knows when to consult different knowledge bases instead of relying on a single source of truth.\n",
        "\n",
        "The demo creates two vector stores: one for the State of the Union address and another for the official Ruff FAQ. Each retriever becomes a tool. The agent can call either tool—or both tools for a multi-source question—and synthesize a grounded answer."
      ]
    },
